  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tSelf Assessment \n\t\tSelf Assessment Help Guide\n\n### How to get SA100 tax-due document\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 2 Jun, 2023 at  2:45 PM\n\n\t\tTo get a SA100 tax-due document to verify and send across to a client. \n\nNavigation: Self Assessment > Selected client > Dashboard\n\nFollowing the navigation process, a user is able to download a summary of the tax-due document.\n\nOnce it has been done, a user is able to verify the document and send it across to a client.\n\nThere is a video guide available on the link below:\n\nhttps://www.loom.com/share/59cb90a2033d4a74a872fa5a54c8263a\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
